title: "Blockchain Secure Platform: Decentralized Identity, Access Control, and Digital Asset Management"
type: software
abstract: >-
  An MVP reference architecture for a blockchain-based platform that integrates
  decentralized identity references, smart-contract-enforced role-based access
  control, NFT-backed digital asset ownership, and an auditable event trail.
